{
  "name": "task_plan",
  "description": "Plan code, repo research and multi-step work in separate tasks. Check machines_list, KB, agents_list and preferences. Main/lead, read-only, user_requested and preapproved plans start now. Others and owner_step need 开始. Check dispatched to-dos and use agent_send. Reminders and events stay separate.\n\nFixed machine_policy keeps the machine and rejects unavailable launchers. Flexible moves portable work after failed health checks and says why. Leads own signals, cards, start fixes, reviews and cancels. Main owns its tasks and receives needs_user. Main may choose a lead. agent_transfer persists ownership. Leads need supervision_policy. Check supervisor and similar work. Use todo_id for an unassigned to-do. Issue/PR URLs in title, goal or prompt block duplicates of open work. Use continues, todo_id or distinct_from. Other hints are advisory.\n\nStarted tasks keep a hub brief (owner request or started_why). Give goal, done_when and out_of_bounds. Writes need done_when (PR/issue defaults to merged+closed unless PR/draft-only). Reads need goal. Omit expect_minutes for auto estimate; positive overrides (manual Agents lack estimate_due). Use continues+continues_why to continue, task_retry for failed starts, task_scope+scope_revision for approved changes.\n\nEdits need readonly=false and authorized write permission; replace read-only Codex with writable for fixes, or use agent_send when permissions match. readonly=true adds a read-only constraint. Claude-family uses bypassPermissions for both; Codex and companion agy use plan unless assistant.readonly_mode=prompt; pi/cursor refuse readonly. Set role=worker, or leader for direct workers via restricted task_plan/task_review (workers cannot delegate).\n\nAn explicit repository URL or path takes precedence. Resolve ambiguity via repositories_list and, if useful, repository_get. A binding gives context only. Verify machine and checkout separately. Non-repository tasks need no lookup; retrieval is not a mandatory dispatch preflight. Owners choose terminal cleanup on Start.\n\nUse {\"backend\":{\"operation_id\":\"\u003cid\u003e\"}} with todo_id for a saved workspace. For a container use {\"container\":{\"selected_repo_ids\":[\"\u003crepo_id\u003e\",...]}} or {\"container\":{\"operation_id\":\"\u003cid\u003e\"}} with todo_id. Repos must be ready. Optional host selects the engine.\n\nWorkspace: \"new\" isolates; {\"new\":{\"branch\":\"task/my-change\"}} names its branch. {\"existing\":\"\u003ccwd or workspace_id\u003e\",\"queue\":true} selects it. queue:true or owner in after queues FIFO until free. Otherwise busy refuses with owner. \"none\" creates nothing. If omitted, readonly uses none. Writable Git follows assistant.task_workspace_preference (prefer-existing unless busy, prefer-new isolates). Explicit existing never switches. Reuse of a new branch needs a clean checkout, no live Agent and no open owner; else refuse with path/owner. Engine creates and registers it. Never run git worktree add. The card previews the path. Default branch: task/\u003ctodo id\u003e. Creation failure starts no Agent. Workspaces stay after acceptance. Follow org read-only refusals; never retry unchanged.\n\n`wait_seconds` observes up to 50s after dispatch. `Inline observation` JSON: `completed` (this input's `reply`), `question` (pending `interaction_id`), `timeout`/`cancelled`/`unavailable`/`interrupted`/`failed`, known input/session ids. It never answers questions, accepts tasks, resends or cancels work. Normal supervision via `task_review` applies. Older nodes may time out to avoid an unrelated reply. Only one immediately dispatchable task waits. Cards and multi-task plans return immediately.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "tasks"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "wait_seconds": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "0/omitted: normal receipt"
      },
      "supervisor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "optional current leader id (assistant.leaders), selected by main; omitted: the planning lead, otherwise main"
      },
      "tasks": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 8,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "title",
            "prompt",
            "role",
            "machine",
            "readonly",
            "user_requested",
            "why"
          ],
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "cwd"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace",
                "todo_id"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "title": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Card title in Chinese, under 20 characters."
            },
            "context": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "extra facts; no project background"
            },
            "prompt": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "goal, bounds and facts; manager adds context, criteria and rules"
            },
            "skip_project_memory": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "default false; true skips project/direction memory; prompt unchanged"
            },
            "machine": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Machine id; fixed by default."
            },
            "machine_policy": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "fixed",
                "flexible"
              ],
              "description": "fixed (default): keep this machine; flexible: permit health-based moves only for portable work"
            },
            "cwd": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Absolute or ~/ project dir, unless workspace.backend or workspace.container supplies it."
            },
            "workspace": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "object"
              ],
              "description": "workspace policy; omit for default; existing: abs/~/path or workspace id on that machine; no custom root",
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "new",
                    "none"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "backend": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "operation_id"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "container": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "selected_repo_ids": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "minItems": 1,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          }
                        },
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "existing"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "existing": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    },
                    "queue": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "new"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "new": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "branch": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "launcher": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "listed launcher; unknown names refused with choices; empty: default/fallback, claude first, why says which"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "agy (Antigravity companion) or an enabled engine"
            },
            "model": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "model id or alias the agent takes; empty: the launcher's default"
            },
            "permission": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "default",
                "acceptEdits",
                "plan",
                "auto",
                "bypassPermissions"
              ],
              "description": "mode; empty: writable default; readonly/replacement/Codex rules: see description; TRAE CLI and omp take none"
            },
            "role": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "worker",
                "leader"
              ],
              "description": "worker: ordinary; leader (any conversation): starts/reviews direct workers"
            },
            "ultracode": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "large tasks (many files, multi-angle checks): Claude Code multi-agent workflows, slower/costlier; small tasks: false; Claude Code 2.1.284+ only; never put in prompt/title"
            },
            "readonly": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "true only for a task that must remain read-only; false for explicitly authorized file changes (see the description). The first message adds「本任务只读：不改项目文件、不提交、不对外写入」 only when true"
            },
            "user_requested": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "True only if the user's latest message asked for it; else false."
            },
            "owner_step": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "money",
                "outward",
                "irreversible"
              ],
              "description": "money, speaking as the user, or an unagreed irreversible step"
            },
            "why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Chinese one-line reason for machine, directory and model."
            },
            "done_when": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Chinese checkable acceptance results told to Agent, one per entry. Nonempty for writable tasks; ignored with continues."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Owner's one-line Chinese outcome. Required read-only; writable defaults to title."
            },
            "out_of_bounds": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Optional forbidden actions/areas, in Chinese, one per entry."
            },
            "continues": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Original todo id; requires continues_why. Reuse todo, original brief and effective criteria even on failed Start; never split. Start stops/releases active prior Agents and reopens if closed. Refuse unauthorized takeover, unreachable Agents that cannot be stopped, or open legacy successors."
            },
            "scope_revision": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues after a scope change: exact task_scope scope_revision; refuse stale plans."
            },
            "continues_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues: one-line stop/replacement reason saved on this plan."
            },
            "distinct_from": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "todo_id",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "todo_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "new tasks only: explain each conflicting open todo. Reasons stay in the brief"
            },
            "started_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "If not just owner-requested (own idea, 督办 or routine): one-line start reason saved in brief."
            },
            "attachments": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 8,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Abs paths of chat pictures/files (Claude/app); copied with updated mentions; others refused."
            },
            "expect_minutes": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "Optional minutes override (omit/0: history or 60m default). Review 1×; stuck 1.5× (min 20m); overdue 3× (min 24h)."
            },
            "project": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Existing kb_list projects slug/name for a clear long-term area; no near-duplicates."
            },
            "audience": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "human",
                "autonomous"
              ],
              "description": "Optional to-do audience."
            },
            "direction_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Direction id."
            },
            "part_of": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Request todo this is a piece of."
            },
            "after": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "With part_of: prerequisite pieces."
            },
            "todo_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Open or failed-start todo this chat opened/supervises; no live Agent. Release stopped Agents at Start. Equals continues if both are given."
            },
            "inbox_item": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Inbox ID or 'none' to skip. Omit to link the sole eligible handoff. Multiple need an ID. No handoff leaves it unlinked. Never files or replies."
            },
            "tier": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Agent preset from the 模型档位 line, by kind of work (old names work); its candidate is picked at start; explicit launcher/model/effort/speed overrides"
            },
            "speed": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "standard",
                "fast",
                "ultrafast"
              ],
              "description": "new-start speed; standard/omitted: launcher default. Codex: fast, ultrafast; Claude Code: fast only"
            },
            "effort": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Explicit effort; omit for tier/purpose default."
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
